GasaCLI commands:
  /agents          Discover installed coding agents
  /backup          Create a local backup
  /backups         List local backups
  /brain           Search the local knowledge base (planned; see issue #11)
  /config          Manage effective configuration
  /doctor          Run local diagnostics
  /exit            Close GasaCLI
  /github          Connect GitHub tools (planned; see issue #11)
  /goal            Start an orchestrated task (planned; see issue #11)
  /help            Show commands and keyboard shortcuts
  /permissions     Configure execution permissions (planned; see issue #31)
  /prompts         Manage prompts
  /quit            Close GasaCLI
  /restore         Restore local data
  /resume          Resume a saved run (planned; see issue #11)
  /setup           Review setup and install guidance
  /skills          Manage local skills (planned; see issue #11)
  /status          Show the current session
  /web             Open or inspect the local dashboard
